{
  "name": "video-generation",
  "label": "短视频生成",
  "description": "主题 → AI脚本生成 → TTS语音 → BGM → HTML预览 → 渲染MP4",
  "params": [
    { "name": "topic", "label": "视频主题", "type": "text", "required": true },
    { "name": "style", "label": "视觉风格", "type": "select", "options": ["Neo-Brutalist", "奶油风", "极简黑白"], "default": "Neo-Brutalist" },
    { "name": "duration", "label": "目标时长(秒)", "type": "number", "default": 40 },
    { "name": "voice_id", "label": "TTS音色", "type": "text", "default": "male-qn-qingse" },
    { "name": "bgm_volume", "label": "BGM音量", "type": "number", "default": 0.3 }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "script",
      "name": "AI 生成脚本",
      "type": "ai",
      "previewType": "code",
      "previewField": "html",
      "prompt": "你是一个专业短视频脚本生成器。根据用户输入的主题，生成完整的短视频脚本内容。\n\n视频规格：1080×1920 竖屏，面向抖音等自媒体平台。\n风格：{style}\n目标时长：{duration}秒\n\n**重要：你只需要生成场景内容，不要生成 <html> <head> <body> 标签，也不要生成 <script> 标签。模板会自动包装你的内容。**\n\n每个场景用 <div class=\"scene s-xxx\"> 包裹（xxx 是场景描述，如 s-title, s-data, s-chart）。内联 CSS 写在 style 属性里，不要用 class。\n\n输出格式必须是严格的 JSON：\n{\n  \"html\": \"纯场景 HTML 字符串，由多个 <div class=\\\"scene s-xxx\\\">...</div> 组成，每个场景内容用中文\",\n  \"narration\": \"完整旁白文本，口语化、自然，每条 ≤20字\",\n  \"bgm_prompt\": \"背景音乐风格描述，如'轻快电子'、'史诗管弦'、'lo-fi 嘻哈'\",\n  \"title\": \"视频标题，10字以内\"\n}\n\n要求：\n1. 开头必须有钩子（前3秒用动态大字+悬念/问题）\n2. 信息密度高，每个场景4-5秒，共 {duration} 秒\n3. 图表用内联SVG（简单的柱状图/折线图）\n4. 禁止使用 jQuery、$ 符号\n5. 输出纯JSON，不要用 markdown 代码块包裹，不要有任何解释文字\n6. 所有文字必须用中文，场景数量 = Math.ceil(时长/5)",
      "timeout": 120000
    },
    {
      "id": "tts",
      "name": "TTS 语音合成",
      "type": "tool",
      "previewType": "audio",
      "previewField": "narration.mp3",
      "module": "./lib/tts.js",
      "function": "generateTTS",
      "args": ["{script.narration}", "{voice_id}", "{executionDir}"]
    },
    {
      "id": "bgm",
      "name": "BGM 生成",
      "type": "tool",
      "previewType": "audio",
      "previewField": "bgm.mp3",
      "module": "./lib/bgm.js",
      "function": "generateBGM",
      "args": ["{script.bgm_prompt}", "{executionDir}"]
    },
    {
      "id": "preview",
      "name": "构建 HTML 预览",
      "type": "tool",
      "previewType": "iframe",
      "previewField": "previewFile",
      "module": "./lib/preview.js",
      "function": "buildPreviewHTML",
      "args": ["{script.html}", "{executionDir}"]
    },
    {
      "id": "render",
      "name": "渲染 MP4",
      "type": "tool",
      "previewType": "video",
      "previewField": "videoFile",
      "module": "./lib/render.js",
      "function": "renderMP4",
      "args": ["{executionDir}"]
    }
  ]
}